<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 20:32:15 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>通货膨胀对美国人造成了如此严重的压力，以至于不断上涨的杂货账单现在成为黑色星期五购物者减少购物的首要原因</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/27/inflation-squeezing-americans-so-hard-rising-grocery-bills-top-reason-cut-back-black-friday-shopping/</link><description>一项新的调查显示，随着生活和杂货成本的上升挤压了购物者的压力，黑色星期五的预算正在萎缩。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/GettyImages-1177457219-e1762368529377.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 19:37:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/27/inflation-squeezing-americans-so-hard-rising-grocery-bills-top-reason-cut-back-black-friday-shopping/</guid></item><item><title>Crate &amp;amp; Barrel 首席执行官计划扩张 50 家门店，以赢得竞争对手的客户：“这绝对是抢占市场的策略。”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/27/crate-barrel-store-expansion-ceo-janet-hayes-market-share-rivals/</link><description>珍妮特·海斯(Janet Hayes)在带领零售商度过了大流行和关税冲击后表示，家具市场缓慢的增长将以牺牲竞争对手为代价。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2232220176.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/27/crate-barrel-store-expansion-ceo-janet-hayes-market-share-rivals/</guid></item><item><title>黄仁勋已经失踪11天了。那是 Nvidia 的继任测试，但主板未通过</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/27/nvidia-jensen-huang-succession-test-board-failed-andrea-petrone/</link><description>无人能取代的首席执行官是无人能拒绝的首席执行官。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/NVI_Jensen-Huang_Horizontal.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/27/nvidia-jensen-huang-succession-test-board-failed-andrea-petrone/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能繁荣还是萧条？ 10 只不为人知的股票精选以及针对这两种情况的投资理念</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/27/how-to-invest-in-2027-ai-boom-bubble-bust-best-etfs-to-protect-your-portfolio/</link><description>没有人知道 2027 年会走向何方。这些赌注旨在无论哪种方式都有效。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/CRA_AI-Rocket_Horizontal.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/27/how-to-invest-in-2027-ai-boom-bubble-bust-best-etfs-to-protect-your-portfolio/</guid></item><item><title>定义 2027 年的 5 个趋势——以及如何投资它们</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/27/best-stocks-to-invest-in-2027-five-market-trends-ai-interest-rates-weight-loss-drugs-solar-energy/</link><description>人工智能的发展和减肥药物的热潮仍在强劲发展。但更高的利率、国防支出的不确定性以及急于建设太阳能项目可能会给不太明显的领域的投资者带来回报。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/STO_Stock-picking_Horizontal.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/27/best-stocks-to-invest-in-2027-five-market-trends-ai-interest-rates-weight-loss-drugs-solar-energy/</guid></item><item><title>香奈儿 (Chanel) 首席执行官莉娜·奈尔 (Leena Nair) 阐述了人类创造的“美丽与创造”。在人工智能饱和的时代，她每年 190 亿美元的业务全靠它</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/27/chanel-ceo-leena-nair-human-made-beauty-creation/</link><description>香奈儿首席执行官表示，商界领袖正在经历一个“前所未有”的转型和脆弱时期，是时候优先考虑人类的聪明才智和才能了&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2149522768.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 13:13:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/27/chanel-ceo-leena-nair-human-made-beauty-creation/</guid></item><item><title>我坐在挪威尖端人工智能新闻编辑室实验的前排。即使人工智能每天处理 200 多个故事，人类仍然会检查每一个故事</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/27/checking-ai-work-human-in-the-loop-newsrooms/</link><description>对于做这项工作的人来说，支票很便宜。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/christoph-trattner.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/27/checking-ai-work-human-in-the-loop-newsrooms/</guid></item><item><title>到 2026 年，许多雇主将放弃基于绩效的加薪，转而采用“花生酱加薪”</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/2026-many-employers-ditching-merit-based-pay-bumps-in-favor-of-peanut-butter-raises/</link><description>与只奖励顶级员工的趋势相反，大约 44% 的公司正在计划将固定加薪平均分配给所有员工，这可能会帮助低收入工人。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/GettyImages-1434119137-1-e1770048872794.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:42:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/2026-many-employers-ditching-merit-based-pay-bumps-in-favor-of-peanut-butter-raises/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普找到了中期失败的罪魁祸首：霍华德·卢特尼克商务部的“虚假”增长数据</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/27/trump-blasts-bea-growth-data-midterm-election-lutnick/</link><description>特朗普在《真相社会》上写道：“这不是一个小错误，这是一个巨大的、有目的的错误。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305643148_d7376b-e1795778555380.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:51:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/27/trump-blasts-bea-growth-data-midterm-election-lutnick/</guid></item><item><title>Dua Lipa 定义了互联网酷。在价值 440 亿美元的创造者经济中，她的继任者可能更难买到</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/27/dua-lipa-cool-girl-influencer-marketing-creator-economy/</link><description>品牌今年将在创作者身上花费 440 亿美元，但 73% 的 13 至 39 岁人群更信任小创作者。战略家看到执念，鬼主接下来崛起&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2251207382-e1795632427239.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:48:00 GMT</pubDa